            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/728240/extras/e37fddfd256b7e986876931a195e009e.poster.avif?t=1669902198\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/728240/extras/e37fddfd256b7e986876931a195e009e.webm?t=1669902198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/728240/extras/e37fddfd256b7e986876931a195e009e.mp4?t=1669902198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Hey! A Terra de Ooo está inundada e cabe ao Finn e ao Jake descobrir a razão. Junta-te aos nossos heróis, explora em mar alto, procura pistas escondidas, interroga suspeitos duvidosos e luta contra piratas para resolver este mistério e salvar o seu mundo submerso!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/728240/extras/63d481d4fb26bcabc6e7a1243bb787f1.poster.avif?t=1669902198\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/728240/extras/63d481d4fb26bcabc6e7a1243bb787f1.webm?t=1669902198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/728240/extras/63d481d4fb26bcabc6e7a1243bb787f1.mp4?t=1669902198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explora livremente a Terra de Ooo, descobre segredos e arrecada despojos com as personagens preferidas dos fãs, o Finn, o Jake, o Beemo e a Merceline<br></li><li>Navega o alto mar entre os reinos e explora territórios desconhecidos para descobrir o que se está a passar<br></li><li>Melhora os teus heróis, utiliza itens, feitiços, poções e as habilidades finais exclusivas dos heróis para combater vilões numa luta tática veloz<br></li><li>Uma aventura inédita com as vozes originais em Inglês</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/728240/extras/59c7199ba8eb98c902bf3aa7d5638cdc.poster.avif?t=1669902198\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/728240/extras/59c7199ba8eb98c902bf3aa7d5638cdc.webm?t=1669902198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/728240/extras/59c7199ba8eb98c902bf3aa7d5638cdc.mp4?t=1669902198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/728240/extras/e37fddfd256b7e986876931a195e009e.poster.avif?t=1669902198\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/728240/extras/e37fddfd256b7e986876931a195e009e.webm?t=1669902198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/728240/extras/e37fddfd256b7e986876931a195e009e.mp4?t=1669902198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Hey! A Terra de Ooo está inundada e cabe ao Finn e ao Jake descobrir a razão. Junta-te aos nossos heróis, explora em mar alto, procura pistas escondidas, interroga suspeitos duvidosos e luta contra piratas para resolver este mistério e salvar o seu mundo submerso!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/728240/extras/63d481d4fb26bcabc6e7a1243bb787f1.poster.avif?t=1669902198\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/728240/extras/63d481d4fb26bcabc6e7a1243bb787f1.webm?t=1669902198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/728240/extras/63d481d4fb26bcabc6e7a1243bb787f1.mp4?t=1669902198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explora livremente a Terra de Ooo, descobre segredos e arrecada despojos com as personagens preferidas dos fãs, o Finn, o Jake, o Beemo e a Merceline<br></li><li>Navega o alto mar entre os reinos e explora territórios desconhecidos para descobrir o que se está a passar<br></li><li>Melhora os teus heróis, utiliza itens, feitiços, poções e as habilidades finais exclusivas dos heróis para combater vilões numa luta tática veloz<br></li><li>Uma aventura inédita com as vozes originais em Inglês</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/728240/extras/59c7199ba8eb98c902bf3aa7d5638cdc.poster.avif?t=1669902198\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/728240/extras/59c7199ba8eb98c902bf3aa7d5638cdc.webm?t=1669902198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/728240/extras/59c7199ba8eb98c902bf3aa7d5638cdc.mp4?t=1669902198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
